<title>HUNGARY: Hungarian overnight rates end flat at 18 percent.</title>
<headline>Hungarian overnight rates end flat at 18 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian overnight rates closed steady on Monday in routine trading on the last day of the banks' two-week reserve period, traders said.</p>
<p>Overnight rates traded between 18.00 and 18.25 percent and closed at 18.00 percent, unchanged from Friday.</p>
<p>Traders said the rates remained low due to continued high liquidity and the fact that the banks already topped up their reserves.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
